# Line-ending normalisation.
#
# This repository is edited from two sides: Windows (PowerShell, local editor)
# and Linux (the agent's sandbox, which writes LF). Without this rule each side
# rewrites every file it touches and the diff stops being readable — a 3-word
# correction shows up as a 400-line change.
#
# eol=lf keeps the working tree identical on both sides, so a diff only ever
# shows what actually changed.

* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.pdf binary
